-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
    shot              mean_luma   split    cool_pix  detail  speckle chroma
                      (.16-.42) (.12-.28)  (>0.25) (.075-.20)(<.009)(<.006)
    HERO_ESTABLISH     0.240 P   0.139 P   0.279 P   0.099 P  0.017  0.011
    INTERIOR_AISLE     0.172 P   0.083 F   0.291 P   0.269 F  0.044  0.020
